---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { examples } from '../data/playground-examples';
---
<BaseLayout title="TongaLang Playground | Leo Mabuku" description="Write and run TongaLang using the actual Python lexer, parser and interpreter, locally in your browser.">
  <section class="page-hero playground-hero"><p class="eyebrow">TongaLang / Interactive playground</p><h1>Programming,<br/><em>closer to home.</em></h1><p>TongaLang is an educational programming language that brings programming concepts into the familiar language of Tonga. Explore an example, change the code, and see your ideas run.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/tongalang/">Behind the language ↗</a></section>
  <section class="section-shell playground-section" aria-label="TongaLang workspace">
    <noscript><p>This playground needs JavaScript to run Python in your browser. You can still <a href="https://github.com/leomabuku/PROJECT">download TongaLang and its examples</a>.</p></noscript>
    <div class="playground" data-tg-playground data-examples={JSON.stringify(examples)}>
      <div class="playground-toolbar"><label for="tg-example">Start with an example<select id="tg-example" data-tg-example>{examples.map((e,i)=><option value={i}>{e.name}</option>)}</select></label><div class="playground-actions"><button type="button" data-tg-reset>Reset example</button><button type="button" data-tg-stop disabled>Stop</button><button type="button" class="button" data-tg-run>Run program <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></div>
      <div class="playground-workspace"><div class="editor-pane"><div class="pane-heading"><label for="tg-source">main.tg / Source code</label><span data-tg-lines></span></div><textarea id="tg-source" data-tg-source spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="off" autocomplete="off" maxlength="20000" aria-describedby="editor-help">{examples[0].source}</textarea><p id="editor-help" class="editor-help">Ctrl / ⌘ + Enter to run. Tab moves to the next control.</p></div><div class="output-pane"><div class="pane-heading"><h2 id="output-heading">Program output</h2><button type="button" data-tg-clear>Clear output</button></div><pre data-tg-output role="region" aria-labelledby="output-heading" tabindex="0">Your output will appear here.</pre><div class="input-pane"><label for="tg-input">Program input <small>One value per line, read by bala()</small></label><textarea id="tg-input" data-tg-input rows="3" maxlength="10000" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Example: Leo, then 42 on the next line">{examples[0].input}</textarea></div></div></div>
      <div class="playground-status"><p role="status" data-tg-status>Ready. Python loads on your first run.</p><span data-tg-time></span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="runtime-note">First run downloads about 14 MB of Python runtime from this site. Code stays in this tab. Supply input before running; missing values produce a clear error. Stop cancels loading or execution.</p>
    <div class="playground-guide"><div><p class="eyebrow">A small starting point</p><h2>Read the language.</h2><p>Tonga-derived keywords, familiar programming concepts. Every program starts with <code>mulimo matalikilo()</code>.</p></div><dl><div><dt><code>zina</code></dt><dd>Declare a variable</dd></div><div><dt><code>amba()</code></dt><dd>Print a value</dd></div><div><dt><code>bala()</code></dt><dd>Read the next input line</dd></div><div><dt><code>kuti / nakunyina</code></dt><dd>If / otherwise</dd></div><div><dt><code>mulimo / pilula</code></dt><dd>Function / return</dd></div><div><dt><code>induluka</code></dt><dd>Repeat over a range</dd></div></dl></div>
    <details class="runtime-details"><summary>Engine source and playground limits</summary><p>The unchanged lexer, PLY parser, AST and interpreter are bundled from <a href="https://github.com/leomabuku/PROJECT/tree/956909b5f64d9114b2796397727be4f665726703" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">TongaLang v0.2.0, revision 956909b ↗</a>. Python runs in a separate worker using Pyodide 0.27.7.</p><p>Limits: 20,000 source characters, 10,000 input characters, 64,000 output characters, 1,000 iterations per loop, 50 function calls deep, and a five-second execution deadline. Each run has fresh variables. This browser playground does not include the desktop IDE’s visual AST explorer or guided editing tools.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/leomabuku/PROJECT/blob/main/TONGALANG_LANGUAGE_REFERENCE.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Full language reference ↗</a></details>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<script>import { initializePlayground, destroyPlayground } from '../scripts/playground'; document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initializePlayground); document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', destroyPlayground); initializePlayground();</script>
<style>
.playground-hero{padding-bottom:2rem}.playground-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.playground-section{padding-block:2rem 5rem}.playground{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}.playground-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.playground-toolbar label{display:grid;gap:.4rem;font-size:.7rem;color:var(--muted)}select{padding:.6rem;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:2px;color:var(--text);font-size:.85rem}.playground-actions{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.playground button:not(.button){background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);padding:.6rem .85rem;font-size:.75rem;border-radius:2px;min-height:44px}.playground .button{font-size:.8rem;min-height:44px}.playground-workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;min-height:380px}.editor-pane,.output-pane{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.editor-pane{border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.pane-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.6rem 1rem;min-height:60px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:.7rem var(--mono);color:var(--muted)}.pane-heading h2{font:inherit;margin:0;letter-spacing:0}.playground textarea{resize:vertical;width:100%;padding:1rem;border:0;background:#080f20;color:var(--text);font:.85rem/1.85 var(--mono);border-radius:0;tab-size:4}.editor-pane textarea{flex:1;min-height:340px;white-space:pre;overflow:auto}.editor-help{font:.6rem/1.6 var(--mono);color:var(--muted);padding:.65rem 1rem;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.output-pane pre{font:.8rem/1.8 var(--mono);padding:1rem;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;overflow:auto;min-height:210px;max-height:400px;flex:1;background:#0c182a;color:#d6e6f5}.output-pane pre[data-error=true]{color:#ffb6a6}.input-pane{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem}.input-pane label{font-size:.75rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}.input-pane small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.65rem}.input-pane textarea{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);padding:.6rem;font-size:.8rem}.playground-status{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--accent);font:.7rem/1.6 var(--mono)}.playground-status p{margin:0}.runtime-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:1rem;max-width:100ch}.playground-guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5%;padding-block:4rem}.playground-guide p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted);max-width:48ch}.playground-guide h2{font-size:2.5rem}.playground-guide dl{margin:0;display:grid;gap:.5rem}.playground-guide dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.8rem}.playground-guide dt{color:var(--accent)}.playground-guide dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.runtime-details{border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.2rem 0;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);padding:.5rem 0}.runtime-details p{margin-top:1rem;max-width:90ch}.runtime-details a{color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:800px){.playground-toolbar{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.playground-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.editor-pane{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.editor-pane textarea{min-height:300px}.playground-guide{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.playground-status{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem}}@media(max-width:420px){.playground-toolbar{padding:.8rem}.playground-actions{gap:.4rem}.playground button:not(.button){padding:.6rem}.playground .button{padding:.6rem .8rem;gap:.5rem}.input-pane label{flex-direction:column;gap:.2rem}.playground textarea{font-size:16px}.playground-guide dl>div{font-size:.7rem}}
</style>
